# The scalars of ECDSA modulo a prime n = 1 + nm: with
# s = k^-1 (e + r d) and w = s^-1, e w + (r w) d == k (verification), and
# (-e) r^-1 + (s r^-1) k == d (recovery); with -s they give -k and the
# same d.

